GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          这支豆子也是来自肯尼亚的尼耶里Nyeri中央大区。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;text-align: left;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Nyeri的大多数咖啡发展和成熟的很慢，会生成极硬豆。这种品质也会明显表现在我们喝到的咖啡里。这就是为什么传统上将尼耶里称为肯尼亚的心脏。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 2em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;text-align: left;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          原产地计划于2018-2019产季在肯尼亚进行了CM精选系列咖啡的试验性项目，位于尼耶里产区的萨格尼则是进行试验项目的所在地。继2019年向市场实验性地投放的CM精选系列的琥珀及红翡翠系列的咖啡豆并取得一致认可后，原产地计划再接再厉于2019-2020年产季将埃塞超级日晒系列的处理方式移植到了肯尼亚咖啡的处理方式上。试验依然放在了位于尼耶里产区的萨格尼。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/vrmzTuqOUhcD64RXnfsDDZ06zzCpegcH3nMiappkx2V4e1xISxnsPggyTHmRx0HiaKAZPvOmIbP15SExd1z4MZZA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 557px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          超级日晒，顾名思义，它是一种有别于常规日晒加工咖啡豆的处理方式。原产地计划团队延续埃塞超级日晒咖啡的处理经验，采取二氧化碳浸渍处理技术(\n          <span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           C\n          </span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           ar\n          </span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           bonic Maceration\n          </span>\n          ，缩写为CM）这种用于红酒制作的加工方式来处理咖啡果实。咖啡鲜果在晾晒前，被整颗放入充满二氧化碳气体的环境中缓慢发酵24-36个小时再取出来晾晒。这样做的目的也是为了利用的二氧化碳的处理方法来发掘咖啡在发酵和发展过程的无限可能。与CM精选系列的咖啡豆相比，超级日晒处理的咖啡豆，由于浸渍时间短，发酵味道没有那么重，对于不喜欢重度发酵但又希望能够轻易地捕捉咖啡风味的消费者来说，超级日晒处理会更受欢迎。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          用二氧化碳浸渍法处理咖啡豆可以提升咖啡的风味。它是将咖啡果或去除果皮的咖啡豆放入恒温恒湿且充满的了二氧化碳的密闭环境中对咖啡豆进行发酵处理，用这样的方法来提升咖啡的风味不会有过氧发酵或生醇发酵而导致咖啡风味变质的风险。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.5440000295639038px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 15px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          特别需要说明的是，当大家首次接触超级日晒处理或CM日晒处理的咖啡豆时，一定不要用常规的方式（比如根据SCA的生豆分级标准）进行挑选，否则就会失去品尝到多层次的风味。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           关于处理\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0980392);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'/>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          在肯尼亚，处理过程简要如下：\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          - 咖农采收鲜果\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          - 采收当天，运送到处理厂；（摩托车，自行车，人力背运都有）\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          - 在处理厂，先将鲜果做挑选；当处理厂的质量员批准后才可计重算作售卖；\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          -很多小农的鲜果会集中一批进行去皮处理\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          -去皮后的带着果胶的咖啡豆静置发酵（无水）\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          -隔天进行水槽中的刷洗\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          -二次浸泡（根据每个处理厂的习惯，可能有不同质量等级的做二次浸泡或者不做）\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          -搬运至晒床晾晒\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          -晾晒约2周左右，收储到处理厂的仓库中\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SUmFynsJ8mZibzFwhDyicticjFTXlrJpJcjxiaqDStcT9MwwM2lMkcO9cZksLTz9doiaPlp0z12qhicDzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<a data-itemshowtype=\"0\" data-linktype=\"2\" hasload=\"1\" href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU4MDQ4MDQ5OA==&amp;mid=2247483997&amp;idx=6&amp;sn=a18ff433ea7f792d4e6a6f3627f6b9d0&amp;chksm=fd577ec0ca20f7d6e696cf212cc39d2ba6d9b0a4a328ad712cc033336dbb1cd22f159001340d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" style=\"color: var(--weui-LINK);cursor: pointer;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           更详细的内容可以参考文章 产区 | 肯尼亚\n          </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡，请关于小程序\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 400px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
